WEBVTT

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.330
The island of the King's Treasure?

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.810
Yes. It's called Crown Island.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.570
Nami-san, you are the best.

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.220
The treasure must be magnificent!

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.500
Let's go already! I'm pumped!

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.460
Let's not.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.770
Why not, Chopper?

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:33.370
We can't just leave treasure and
not steal it.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.100
But there'll be pirates there!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.410
You're one, too.

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:39.090
Ah! I forgot...

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:40.450
Hey...

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.970
But what if you get really hurt?

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:46.700
That's what we have you for.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:47.970
Yeah, but...

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:53.460
You worry about stupid things.
Worry about the monsters!

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.730
Monsters?

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.810
Vampire penguins and
man-eating clams!

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:02.490
Violent fried octopi
and carnivorous dumplings!

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:03.780
Yeah right.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.330
Oh sorry...
A monster!!

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.770
Hey, I'm not a monster!

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:14.130
You're too scared.
You need to fight with us.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.090
I fight bravely if I really have to!

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:20.890
Just don't run away when it counts.

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:26.140
I'm a pirate now. I don't run away!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.250
What's going on?

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.210
Land ahoy!

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:52.770
Underwater volcanoes!

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:58.890
Look there!

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.050
It's forming a circle!

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:05.370
A circle?

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.770
Is that... is that...?

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:15.210
Yes. I'm sure of it.

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:19.010
It's Crown Island!

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:25.290
Chopper's Kingdom in the
Strange Animal Island

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:44.250
Woohoo! What a nice looking island!

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.090
Sorry to spoil your fun...

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.970
Chopper!

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.100
Chopper!

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:12.020
Hey...everyone all right?

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.210
I think I'm dead...

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:21.490
Oh, Nami-san...
I've died and gone to heaven...

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:28.250
- Get off me!
- You're cute when you're angry!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.340
You there.

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:33.170
What do you want here?

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:36.210
W...what? That bird talks?

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:38.850
It's a parrot. Parrots speak.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.540
Not on its own like that!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:45.490
Human tongue is no problem for me.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:51.490
But I have to admit that only I and
Raventi can talk like this.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.890
Wow! This island is so cool!

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.010
Who are you?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:59.410
Hey, have you seen Chopper?

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:00.570
Chopper?

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:10.170
Chimerion...

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:11.290
Mobambi.

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:17.770
Our king has fulfilled his duty
and died. You can't mourn forever.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.810
I know, Raventi...

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:36.830
When the crown envelops the isle,
Heaven shall give us new blood.

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:40.290
But is that really true?

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.810
Will we really get a new king?

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:44.890
I think so.

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:48.810
The elders have always said so.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:54.770
An animal king from heaven?
There's no way.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.250
Kiiiiiiiiii...!

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.050
It's saying "king"!

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:10.790
From the heavens!

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:14.010
Kiiiiiiiiii...!

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:35.660
The animal king! It's our king!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.210
Animal...king?

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.330
King? Where?

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:44.210
Amazing!
He can speak human tongue!

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.490
Are you the animal king?

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:50.170
Stop joking! You're the king of all!

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:53.970
The legend was true!
It's our new king!

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:55.090
King?

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:58.130
I'm the animal king?!

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:02.410
I'm hungry!

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:07.810
Just fields and jungle everywhere.
We'll starve to death.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:10.690
Why are you following us?

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:15.610
Silence, human!
We are watching your every step.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:19.650
Relax, we're not here to eat you.

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:21.330
I want meat!

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:24.890
Meat! Gimme meat! I'm hungry!

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.330
I don't trust them.

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:34.530
What a weird pig!

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:37.090
It's a pile of pork!

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:41.250
It's a messenger pig!
A new king has been crowned.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.690
A new king?

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.370
What a herd!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.970
This many?

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:54.490
It's a celebration for the new king!

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.970
What's all this about?

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.130
Square rhinos!

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.210
That's awesome!

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.020
Why am I the king?

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.860
You came from the heavens.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:11.810
But these clothes...

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:15.250
Those are my old...
oh, never mind.

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:16.610
No, wait!

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:18.010
I'm going home.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:21.930
But you must stay here
and protect the isle!

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:25.090
I'm not the king!
I'm Tony Tony Chopper!

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:29.250
Chopper? A fine name.
I'm Mobambi.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:30.370
Really?

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:35.970
My teacher, the best doctor of all,
gave me this name.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.130
You're a doctor? Great!

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:42.050
Some of us are hurt.
You're amazing!

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:43.690
Me... amazing?

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:46.970
Of course! We can count on you.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:48.770
Well, I suppose.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.940
And you're very brave.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:53.130
You idiot!

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:55.690
Amazing! You're the best!

00:07:56.420 --> 00:08:00.610
You won't make me
happy with compliments!

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.490
You certainly look happy...

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:06.490
Now we will celebrate our new king!

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:09.450
First, the king shall speak.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:13.210
Wait, I'm not the king...

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:14.410
You're not?

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:15.970
Sorry, I'm...

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:19.450
Kiiiiiiiiii...!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:23.180
He said "King!" It's him!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.330
A fine speech!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.650
This place is awesome!

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:05.450
He's at home here.

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:06.610
Truly.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:12.490
I made these fancy suits for us!
Aren't you gonna play?

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.530
I don't think so.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:19.570
This is so fun!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.210
- Horn Eaters!
- What?

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:33.500
They attack all animals with horns.
They have killed all our elders.

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.290
Then let's get started!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.810
No, stupid! Let's run!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:44.090
Why are they following me?

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:47.810
- They attack all who have horns.
- Horns?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:51.650
Hey! Wait up!

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:54.860
Go away!

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:00.810
Don't throw them in front of you!

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:09.170
Don't worry. You'll get better.

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:13.490
Amazing, Chopper!
We're so glad you're our king.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:17.610
I can only be king
as long as I am here.

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:18.850
What do you mean?

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:22.810
I must return to my pirate ship soon.

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:26.820
Pirate...? Are you a... pirate?

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:28.890
Yes. It's strange...

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:34.420
You're a human living with animals.
And I travel with humans.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:38.830
Where are they?
They should come for me.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:43.030
Don't leave!
You're our king! Forget them!

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.650
What're you doing?

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:48.450
You can't just leave, you're our friend!

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:52.370
Don't be a pirate, stay here!

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:56.140
Mobambi... do you hate pirates?

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:03.370
My dad was killed by pirates.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.450
What's this?

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:13.450
The ruins of my dad's ship.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:20.890
He was a biologist.
But on his way here...

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:23.490
Dad!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:33.050
You can't do a thing!
Sit back or get hurt!

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:39.090
Daaaad!

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:48.530
And I got stranded on this island...

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:53.570
And our old king Chimerion
raised me as one of his.

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:55.810
I hate pirates!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.730
But my friends are nice pirates.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.170
There are no nice pirates!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:03.490
But once you meet them...

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:06.620
I know!
I'll ask Luffy if you can come...

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.430
I'll never side with a pirate!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.850
- Mobambi.
- You can't be with them.

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:18.340
You're an animal. You'll be much
happier living with us!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:05.290
Have you seen Chopper? This guy.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:09.220
Not a very good picture, huh.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.580
Like this! Have you seen him?

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.060
I haven't.

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.130
What's that sound?

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:18.370
Humans?

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.650
Let's take a look.

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:22.290
OK.

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:24.820
What a haul!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:27.860
I drool at the sight of these horns!

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:31.140
Sir Butler, here's ketchup and mayo.

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:32.290
Idiot!

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:33.530
Huh?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.490
Where's the mustard?

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.490
Here it is.

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:47.450
How is it? Do you feel anything?

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.770
Nothing. Next!

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:53.810
Are those bones any good?

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:56.090
How dare you barge in!

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.420
We're looking for this guy.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:02.250
Who do you think I am?

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:05.130
You'd better watch your mouths!

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:08.150
Or you'll get what's coming to you.

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:16.730
Ow ow ow ow ow!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:17.890
Are you all right?

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:19.090
Take this!

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.090
I don't want mustard!

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:23.740
- Then this!
- Not ketchup either!

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:29.770
Now you know how dangerous I am.

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:33.050
Do you want to hear more?

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:37.060
- No thanks.
- I see, then I'll tell you all.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.170
We said no.

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:44.090
I'm a brilliant inventor and biologist,
and expert treasure hunter.

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:48.810
The world's ultra genius Baron Butler!

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:52.130
World's ultra genius!?

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:56.810
And I'm general Hot Dog,
strongest in the world.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:59.610
Strongest in the world?

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:03.770
Pirates call me Dog the fierce.

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:07.570
And I am the most handsome man,

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:09.730
Snake!

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:11.890
Most handsome man?

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:14.890
NO woman escapes me.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.970
I'm the seductive Snake!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.370
Here.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.570
Here.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.090
Don't feed us!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:27.010
Hey, are you looking for
the King's Treasure?

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:29.250
Of course, fair lady.

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:34.010
Ooh, you're so handsome!
Tell me about the treasure.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:37.290
Of course! But on one condition.

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:38.410
Condition?

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:42.130
If you want to know,
you must join my crew.

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:45.850
That's it?
Of course I'll join you!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.090
No way!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:52.490
Luffy, this is our chance
to get information!

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:54.410
You're a baddie, right?

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:58.130
Fool! What makes you think I'm bad?

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:01.610
- Just a hunch.
- How dare you?!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.420
What's the matter?

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:09.740
Don't mess up my plan! I'm trying
to get hints on the treasure!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.410
Why'd you hit me, then?

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.210
Just play along!

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.010
You're mad...

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:18.450
Sir Butler. They smell like dimwits.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.050
Nut cases.

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:25.090
That's too bad. I can't tell dimwits
about the treasure.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.530
- Pretty please!
- My darlings!

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:29.930
No way!

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:36.610
I can't tell you that whoever finds it,
will get power to shake the heavens!

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:40.370
And certainly not that it's the power

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:44.010
of a certain animal horn!

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:50.130
And that this violin can control
the Horn Eaters...

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:54.530
that gather up all horns so 
I can investigate them.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:59.250
That, I can never reveal to you,
no matter what!

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:03.090
Dammit! I gave away everything!

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:06.490
How dare you force him to tell?!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.100
Um, he just told us.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:12.300
Silence!
Sir Butler cannot keep secrets.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.290
I cannot let you return alive!

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:17.610
Where's your logic, man?

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.650
Come, Horn Eaters!

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:24.250
Kill these dimwits!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.890
Why'd you run amok, Luffy?

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:58.060
- No idea.
- You're about as smart.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.290
Really? Thanks!

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:01.340
That wasn't a compliment.

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:02.650
It wasn't?

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:06.770
Ahhh! Crocodiles!

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:07.970
Seems like it.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:10.570
Luffy, do something!

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:12.730
Gum-Gum...

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.010
Balloon!

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:29.810
So the treasure is an animal horn?

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:32.490
In West Blue I heard

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:35.890
of a medicine extracted from horns.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:39.370
It was worth more than gold.

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.530
Almost like a Devil Fruit.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:43.330
Maybe.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.810
It's their work.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:49.010
Horrible.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:52.970
Chopper could probably cure them.

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:56.330
But if they're hunting horns...

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:58.700
Chopper's in danger!

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.700
He'll be fine.

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:02.050
Eh?

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:05.170
He's pretty strong. And tenacious!

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:06.530
Is he?

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:10.180
He's one of us.
Of course he's strong!

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:11.450
Right?

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.570
Yup, that's right.

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:15.730
I agree.

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:19.210
Are you really sure?

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:21.420
Shouldn't we go look for him?

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.730
Look for him how?

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:26.970
I know! Let's ask the animal king.

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:29.930
Yeah! Let's go see the king!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.090
Right.

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:36.370
What now?

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:41.610
Sorry, but we're in a hurry.
Take us to the animal king.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:42.850
What?

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:46.050
If you take us to your king,

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:48.820
you get to eat my hair.

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:49.650
Now go!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:53.170
You're heavy! Get off!

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:58.370
It seems they survived.

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:02.290
But in return we got some
nice information.

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:05.850
Who would have thought
they had a king?

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:10.330
That king must know
where the treasure is.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:18.310
What? Evil humans are controlling
the Horn Eaters to attack us?!

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:25.370
Don't worry! We have a new king.
He will defeat the evil ones.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:31.290
Idiot! What're you saying?
What if I get hurt!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:33.210
You won't help us?

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:36.490
Well, I mean...

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:37.890
Mobambi!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.810
Humans are coming this way.

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:42.410
Humans?

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:49.460
That's them! Chopper...

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:56.130
You're strong, right?
After all, you're the King...

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.210
Please!

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:03.900
Will you just leave us like that?

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.770
No...no I won't!

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:13.530
If I really have to...
I will fight!

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:19.260
Who is this animal king?

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:24.730
He's gotta be big and fierce!
I bet he's 50 metres tall!

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:26.690
50 metres?! Cool!

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:32.610
They're vile humans.
They plan to kill us and take our furs.

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:34.970
Yeah! And he has ten...

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:37.810
no, one hundred horns!

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:39.170
What?!

00:21:39.260 --> 00:21:42.970
Yeah. And they'll fry and eat us!

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:44.850
That's so horrible!

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.130
And not just that.

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:51.810
It's gotta be
an elephant-bear-lion-tiger-monster!

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:54.730
Isn't that a bit too cool?

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:55.970
"Cool?!"

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:09.580
Where's the animal king?

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:20.410
Waah! A monster!

00:22:20.780 --> 00:22:23.450
- Luffy!
- Chopper!

00:22:23.590 --> 00:22:25.810
- Chopper!
- You made it!

00:22:25.980 --> 00:22:27.340
What a get-up.

00:22:27.420 --> 00:22:29.050
Did you come for me?

00:22:29.220 --> 00:22:31.490
You had us worried.

00:22:33.100 --> 00:22:36.770
What are you doing, King?
Fight them!

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:38.890
King?

00:22:39.030 --> 00:22:40.580
Are you...

00:22:40.740 --> 00:22:42.810
Yeah! He's our king!

00:22:42.940 --> 00:22:47.060
Stupid humans!
Our king will punch you to death!

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:49.890
You're the animal king...?

00:22:49.980 --> 00:22:51.930
Have you seen this guy?

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:56.170
1,000 metres tall, fangs, horns, whales...

00:22:56.340 --> 00:22:57.930
That's Chopper!

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:01.290
What?! When did you get so cool?!

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:03.330
Get a better brain.

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:07.650
Don't worry, they're nice.
My friends!

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:08.780
'Sup!

00:23:10.540 --> 00:23:11.970
P...pirates?

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:14.570
Yeah! Amazing, eh?

00:23:16.860 --> 00:23:20.450
I'm hungry! Chopper, got some food?

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.820
I'll get you something.

00:23:22.980 --> 00:23:24.130
Yippee!

00:23:24.230 --> 00:23:27.100
That's the king for you!

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:36.210
Great! This is actually super tasty!

00:23:38.660 --> 00:23:42.700
You're really hungry.
I'll get you some more.

00:23:43.620 --> 00:23:47.530
But who'd have thought
Chopper was the king?

00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:51.410
Not anyone can become royalty.

00:23:51.540 --> 00:23:54.660
But I'm more the prince type.

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:57.300
Coming on a white horse and...

00:23:57.380 --> 00:23:59.010
- Idiot.
- What?

00:23:59.140 --> 00:24:02.410
Shut your trap and eat, Prince.

00:24:03.260 --> 00:24:06.530
Says the dim-witted musclehead.

00:24:06.660 --> 00:24:07.980
What?

00:24:12.980 --> 00:24:16.170
There's nothing "nice"
about these guys!

00:24:16.460 --> 00:24:18.780
- Hey, runt!
- I'm Mobambi!

00:24:18.900 --> 00:24:20.930
Don't you have any meat here?

00:24:21.140 --> 00:24:24.050
Me...me...meat?!

00:24:28.420 --> 00:24:29.900
You scared them!

00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:31.660
Well done, idiot!

00:24:31.780 --> 00:24:36.530
When you've finished, leave!
And don't ever come back!

00:24:36.660 --> 00:24:40.130
Can't you just tell us
about the King's Treasure?

00:24:40.420 --> 00:24:42.610
King's Treasure?

00:24:42.780 --> 00:24:47.170
You have been fooled.
There is no such thing.

00:24:47.420 --> 00:24:49.330
Please...pretty please?

00:24:49.460 --> 00:24:53.900
Leave it, Nami.
Let's just take Chopper and go.

00:24:54.020 --> 00:24:59.220
No! Chopper is our king now!
He'll stay here and protect us!

00:24:59.340 --> 00:25:03.650
No way, no way.
That coward could never do that.

00:25:03.780 --> 00:25:05.450
He's our king!

00:25:05.820 --> 00:25:09.330
You've really taken a liking to him,
eh, Montblanc?

00:25:09.460 --> 00:25:10.780
It's Mobambi!

00:25:10.860 --> 00:25:13.450
But Chopper's one of us.

00:25:13.820 --> 00:25:18.690
Shut up, pirate!
He's definitely more one of us!

00:25:18.820 --> 00:25:21.970
And he'll stay on this island with us!

00:25:28.100 --> 00:25:29.210
That's...!

00:25:29.340 --> 00:25:31.370
Dad's old ship!

00:25:31.500 --> 00:25:32.690
What's up?

00:25:32.940 --> 00:25:35.100
What what?

00:25:35.820 --> 00:25:37.460
You've trapped us!

00:25:37.580 --> 00:25:39.250
You eat too much!

00:25:39.380 --> 00:25:40.500
That's odd...

00:25:42.220 --> 00:25:46.180
It must be them.
They're looking for the treasure!

00:25:59.260 --> 00:26:00.860
Oh no!

00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:03.250
They're the ones?

00:26:03.780 --> 00:26:08.170
I found it! This holds the secret
of the King's Treasure!

00:26:08.590 --> 00:26:10.890
What? Dad's log book?

00:26:11.020 --> 00:26:12.810
Is the treasure for real?

00:26:12.980 --> 00:26:15.250
Don't you know about it?

00:26:15.460 --> 00:26:20.660
All the elders who knew
were killed by Horn Eaters.

00:26:21.060 --> 00:26:25.690
The treasure rests in the horns
of the Golden Beast.

00:26:25.860 --> 00:26:27.610
In a horn?

00:26:27.860 --> 00:26:32.980
It holds a mystic power,
the power of all animals.

00:26:33.100 --> 00:26:35.660
When the King dies,

00:26:35.750 --> 00:26:38.770
his successor inherits this power...

00:26:38.940 --> 00:26:43.130
turning this island into
the Paradise of Beasts.

00:26:43.580 --> 00:26:45.580
Thanks for the info!

00:26:45.740 --> 00:26:50.370
You again!
And again you steal our secrets!

00:26:50.460 --> 00:26:53.290
Your boss is just too talkative!

00:26:53.420 --> 00:26:55.450
He can't keep secrets...

00:26:55.660 --> 00:26:59.010
Why you...where's the animal king?

00:26:59.140 --> 00:27:03.140
Give him to me,
and I will spare you all!

00:27:03.300 --> 00:27:07.180
If not, I'll set
the Horn Eaters on you!

00:27:08.740 --> 00:27:12.290
Oh no, not them again!
They'll get us!

00:27:30.860 --> 00:27:32.130
Chopper!

00:27:35.100 --> 00:27:36.860
Who are you?

00:27:37.700 --> 00:27:38.690
I am...

00:27:40.820 --> 00:27:44.010
Tony Tony Chopper, the animal king!

00:27:44.350 --> 00:27:46.050
You... the king?

00:27:46.140 --> 00:27:49.770
That little gnome can't be the king!

00:27:49.940 --> 00:27:53.370
But he is! And he will kill you all!

00:27:53.500 --> 00:27:54.660
Interesting...

00:27:54.780 --> 00:27:58.820
Stop the Horn Eaters
and fight me like a man!

00:28:01.700 --> 00:28:05.930
I will, on condition that you defeat
the Horn Eaters.

00:28:06.260 --> 00:28:07.300
What?

00:28:07.380 --> 00:28:10.130
So good luck, runt!

00:28:11.460 --> 00:28:14.730
Push harder! We gotta get out!

00:28:14.940 --> 00:28:17.740
Shut up and push yourself!

00:28:17.860 --> 00:28:20.330
If only he could stop eating!

00:28:20.460 --> 00:28:23.180
But I'm still hungry.

00:28:23.300 --> 00:28:24.450
Get real!

00:28:27.910 --> 00:28:29.810
Here they come!

00:28:30.220 --> 00:28:34.890
Now it's time to bring forth
my new weapon!

00:28:35.060 --> 00:28:36.970
Usopp boomerang!

00:28:37.270 --> 00:28:41.810
One little throw of this,
and you'll never come back!

00:28:45.230 --> 00:28:47.170
It doesn't come back.

00:28:47.300 --> 00:28:49.730
I told you it doesn't come back!

00:28:49.860 --> 00:28:50.970
Idiot!

00:28:55.500 --> 00:28:57.060
Chopper!

00:28:57.900 --> 00:29:00.250
- What's he doing alone?
- Chopper!

00:29:13.020 --> 00:29:13.770
What?

00:29:16.220 --> 00:29:17.790
Go get him!

00:29:27.500 --> 00:29:29.650
Chopper! Where is he?

00:29:29.980 --> 00:29:31.410
He ran away...

00:29:31.500 --> 00:29:35.580
Maybe it's true that
he's just a weak coward?

00:29:35.740 --> 00:29:36.980
Dimwit.

00:29:37.060 --> 00:29:39.130
Let's go save him.

00:29:40.140 --> 00:29:42.140
Is he done for?

00:29:43.660 --> 00:29:45.090
Wanna come?

00:29:45.460 --> 00:29:46.650
But...

00:29:46.860 --> 00:29:50.130
Don't. You can't do anything for him.

00:29:50.340 --> 00:29:53.370
Yes. You'll get yourself killed.

00:29:53.500 --> 00:29:54.730
Coming?

00:29:54.820 --> 00:29:57.850
If I were stronger, I'd go with you.

00:29:57.980 --> 00:29:59.650
But I...

00:30:00.150 --> 00:30:04.450
You can't do a thing!
Sit back or get hurt!

00:30:06.820 --> 00:30:10.090
I can't do anything against...them!

00:30:10.380 --> 00:30:16.090
Who cares if you're weak!
So am I, but I'm not scared at all!

00:30:16.220 --> 00:30:17.410
Look at your legs.

00:30:18.060 --> 00:30:21.810
You never know unless
you give yourself a chance.

00:30:23.460 --> 00:30:24.450
Right?

00:30:25.260 --> 00:30:26.250
Don't be silly!

00:30:26.340 --> 00:30:31.700
OK, runt. But staying together isn't
the only way to be a friend.

00:30:34.460 --> 00:30:37.140
I'm not a runt...

00:30:40.340 --> 00:30:42.300
I'm Mobambi!

00:30:47.230 --> 00:30:49.530
I can't let them get hurt...

00:31:15.820 --> 00:31:17.380
Hey...

00:31:18.220 --> 00:31:21.890
If we...all get together and fight...

00:31:22.380 --> 00:31:25.530
You want us to follow an impostor?

00:31:25.660 --> 00:31:31.610
You heard them. He who inherits
the horn is the king. It's not him.

00:31:31.710 --> 00:31:37.330
We must decide on a king and give
him the horn of Chimerion.

00:31:44.220 --> 00:31:45.540
But...

00:32:10.740 --> 00:32:11.980
<i>Doctor...</i>

00:32:24.340 --> 00:32:25.330
Chopper!

00:32:54.830 --> 00:32:55.480
What?

00:33:03.780 --> 00:33:05.970
Who the devil are you?

00:33:10.620 --> 00:33:11.770
A prince.

00:33:13.700 --> 00:33:14.430
Sanji!

00:33:14.430 --> 00:33:15.130
Zoro!

00:33:15.580 --> 00:33:17.450
What a show-off.

00:33:23.150 --> 00:33:26.210
Back away, Chopper. This guy's mine.

00:33:26.430 --> 00:33:32.450
Little dimwit. I'll give you a taste of
my kicks that split steel!

00:33:39.180 --> 00:33:40.930
You can't get away.

00:33:45.870 --> 00:33:47.340
Gum-Gum...

00:33:47.700 --> 00:33:50.730
Rocket!

00:33:53.350 --> 00:33:55.050
Luffy!

00:33:56.380 --> 00:33:58.690
- Chopper!
- You came!

00:33:58.990 --> 00:34:01.370
Rest assured! Usopp's here!

00:34:01.500 --> 00:34:03.930
- Really!
- Go, Luffy!

00:34:04.020 --> 00:34:05.170
Go yourself!

00:34:05.340 --> 00:34:09.490
A...are you mad?
Heroes should come in last!

00:34:09.860 --> 00:34:13.930
How about not underestimating me?!

00:34:14.060 --> 00:34:15.050
Who, you?

00:34:15.220 --> 00:34:17.970
Go to hell, all of you!

00:34:18.140 --> 00:34:19.820
Oh no! The Horn Eaters!

00:34:19.940 --> 00:34:21.010
Luffy!

00:34:21.140 --> 00:34:22.490
Get him!

00:34:30.980 --> 00:34:32.890
Run for your lives!

00:34:35.180 --> 00:34:38.330
Forgive me, Chimerion.

00:34:39.860 --> 00:34:41.050
What are you doing?

00:34:41.380 --> 00:34:43.530
Chopper's in danger.

00:34:43.660 --> 00:34:45.820
You'll be exiled!

00:34:45.900 --> 00:34:49.530
But they're after Chopper's horns.

00:34:49.700 --> 00:34:51.190
If I give them this...

00:34:51.340 --> 00:34:53.610
Forget the reindeer.

00:34:54.420 --> 00:34:57.810
There is nothing we can do,

00:34:57.900 --> 00:35:00.700
except leave it to our future king.

00:35:00.940 --> 00:35:04.170
Are you deserting Chopper?

00:35:04.260 --> 00:35:07.690
He did all that because we asked him to!

00:35:07.780 --> 00:35:12.090
That power is for the animals.
Not for humans.

00:35:12.220 --> 00:35:13.730
But...

00:35:13.860 --> 00:35:17.330
Don't worry. He understands.

00:35:17.460 --> 00:35:19.300
Just give him some time.

00:35:19.660 --> 00:35:22.010
He's in your hands, Raventi.

00:35:23.060 --> 00:35:25.330
You're giving up on Chopper too?

00:35:25.460 --> 00:35:28.570
Idiot! You wanna get thrown out?

00:36:02.540 --> 00:36:03.490
Creep...

00:36:20.780 --> 00:36:22.130
I'm impressed.

00:36:22.620 --> 00:36:26.330
You can stand up after my kicks.

00:36:26.780 --> 00:36:28.770
But for how long?

00:36:39.260 --> 00:36:42.060
- Usopp!
- Nami! Help!

00:36:42.180 --> 00:36:43.610
This way, hurry!

00:36:43.820 --> 00:36:45.610
Got it! Chopper!

00:36:46.700 --> 00:36:47.890
You OK?

00:36:49.940 --> 00:36:50.970
My god!

00:36:54.740 --> 00:36:57.890
Damn it all! Go, Chopper!

00:36:59.660 --> 00:37:00.690
Usopp Boomerang!

00:37:00.980 --> 00:37:02.930
Leave it, Usopp!

00:37:04.140 --> 00:37:05.620
Watch this.

00:37:05.860 --> 00:37:07.180
Usopp...

00:37:07.740 --> 00:37:10.770
Horn Eaters! Here I am!

00:37:11.340 --> 00:37:12.410
Are you mad?

00:37:20.580 --> 00:37:21.610
Now go!

00:37:28.140 --> 00:37:29.540
Usopp! That rock!

00:37:30.100 --> 00:37:34.170
Blow up the earth just below it!
Hurry!

00:37:34.300 --> 00:37:35.970
Are you sure?

00:37:36.460 --> 00:37:40.580
I am! A Powder Star
should be enough!

00:37:41.420 --> 00:37:42.690
OK!

00:37:43.860 --> 00:37:45.370
Hurry up!

00:38:01.340 --> 00:38:03.370
We did it!

00:38:03.460 --> 00:38:06.020
We trapped the Horn Eaters!

00:38:06.100 --> 00:38:09.050
They can't get out!

00:38:09.220 --> 00:38:11.490
Where's Chopper?

00:38:14.740 --> 00:38:17.210
I found you!

00:38:19.140 --> 00:38:20.850
Chopper!

00:38:20.990 --> 00:38:23.700
Where in the world am I?

00:38:24.900 --> 00:38:28.330
Hey! You there! Heeey!

00:38:38.260 --> 00:38:39.660
Slippery eel!

00:38:40.100 --> 00:38:43.730
The King's Treasure is mine!

00:38:44.140 --> 00:38:45.770
Hold it!

00:38:46.270 --> 00:38:48.900
- The treasure is here!
- No...

00:38:49.340 --> 00:38:53.300
It's the horns of Chimerion!
The real treasure!

00:38:53.540 --> 00:38:56.050
What? That must be...

00:38:56.180 --> 00:39:00.490
That's the golden crown of the
Golden Beast!

00:39:00.790 --> 00:39:02.490
Then come get them!

00:39:02.620 --> 00:39:04.100
You bet I will!

00:39:04.220 --> 00:39:05.710
No...stop!

00:39:06.020 --> 00:39:07.690
Will this work?

00:39:07.820 --> 00:39:11.330
Yes. These horns are our guardians!

00:39:11.460 --> 00:39:12.780
What if we fail?

00:39:12.900 --> 00:39:14.250
Stop, you!

00:39:16.260 --> 00:39:19.730
Look at you trembling.
Give me the horns!

00:39:19.860 --> 00:39:22.210
I'm not afraid of you!

00:39:22.340 --> 00:39:23.900
You wanna die?

00:39:23.980 --> 00:39:25.540
Speak for yourself!

00:39:25.700 --> 00:39:31.090
You sound brave, but all you do
is run. The horns are mine!

00:39:35.100 --> 00:39:36.770
Mobambi!

00:39:37.220 --> 00:39:38.650
Come on!

00:39:38.780 --> 00:39:39.900
You little brat!

00:39:41.620 --> 00:39:42.970
No! We're falling!

00:39:46.460 --> 00:39:48.490
Mobambi...he's...!

00:39:57.060 --> 00:40:00.260
That was close. You're crazy!

00:40:00.740 --> 00:40:05.290
But, I just wanted
to help out my friend...

00:40:05.420 --> 00:40:07.610
Being together isn't all that counts..

00:40:08.820 --> 00:40:09.860
OK.

00:40:12.220 --> 00:40:17.210
Mobambi! They're...they're gone!
The King's horns!

00:40:42.420 --> 00:40:43.740
The King's Treasure...!

00:40:55.020 --> 00:40:59.020
Finally...the ultimate power is mine!

00:41:06.100 --> 00:41:08.250
Good riddance.

00:41:10.740 --> 00:41:11.770
Dammit...

00:41:11.910 --> 00:41:16.050
Idiot...why do you keep fighting?

00:41:16.590 --> 00:41:19.410
Oh, I get it. It's for that girl.

00:41:19.540 --> 00:41:21.100
It's all for her.

00:41:21.620 --> 00:41:24.540
You've got it wrong.

00:41:25.620 --> 00:41:31.130
I'm fighting for those I have
vowed to protect with my life!

00:41:31.500 --> 00:41:34.330
For your pals?
Don't make me laugh.

00:41:34.460 --> 00:41:37.190
You can't protect anything, weakling.

00:41:40.740 --> 00:41:42.220
Weakling?

00:41:44.780 --> 00:41:47.690
Just who do you think I am?

00:41:52.340 --> 00:41:57.930
Impossible... how can you move
after all those cuts I gave you?

00:41:58.820 --> 00:42:00.730
Are you stupid?

00:42:01.380 --> 00:42:04.890
Your cuts are nothing
compared to his.

00:42:05.620 --> 00:42:07.410
Now who's the weakling?

00:42:10.500 --> 00:42:15.620
You've withstood my kicks well,
but now you're out of options.

00:42:15.780 --> 00:42:17.570
I'll finish you now!

00:42:26.980 --> 00:42:29.780
And that was that.

00:42:35.500 --> 00:42:36.690
How in the world...?

00:42:37.140 --> 00:42:41.770
Kicks that split steel?
Don't make me laugh.

00:42:43.540 --> 00:42:47.210
Let's see how strong you are now.

00:42:53.180 --> 00:42:56.730
You can barely stand from my kicks.

00:42:57.270 --> 00:43:00.490
And all your friends are done for.

00:43:00.860 --> 00:43:04.300
Those guys? Not a chance.

00:43:04.500 --> 00:43:05.460
What?

00:43:05.620 --> 00:43:10.290
They're way stronger
than you'll ever know.

00:43:10.500 --> 00:43:11.530
What?

00:43:12.220 --> 00:43:16.970
Strength isn't about power,
or techniques.

00:43:17.870 --> 00:43:19.210
It's in the soul!

00:43:21.500 --> 00:43:25.890
Dammit. I am the strongest of all!

00:43:27.580 --> 00:43:28.650
Now you die!

00:43:29.860 --> 00:43:30.930
Whirl...

00:43:32.780 --> 00:43:35.450
wind!!

00:43:36.780 --> 00:43:41.570
But how? My kicks are
the most powerful of all!

00:43:44.110 --> 00:43:45.810
I know a guy

00:43:45.900 --> 00:43:49.730
who kicks way harder than you ever can.

00:43:50.140 --> 00:43:52.090
A really annoying guy.

00:43:54.660 --> 00:43:57.050
Gum-Gum Pistol!

00:43:59.620 --> 00:44:01.020
Straw Hat!

00:44:19.820 --> 00:44:20.970
Chopper!

00:44:21.100 --> 00:44:22.660
Watch out!

00:44:36.380 --> 00:44:39.930
Was that all?
I was just getting started.

00:44:40.340 --> 00:44:42.810
I...I'm not done with you!

00:44:42.980 --> 00:44:45.410
You're all but dead.

00:44:45.500 --> 00:44:49.050
I don't care!
You stole their true treasure...!

00:44:49.430 --> 00:44:52.060
We humans can take from animals

00:44:52.140 --> 00:44:55.810
what we want! Why do you care?

00:44:56.500 --> 00:44:58.090
Why do I care...?

00:44:58.580 --> 00:45:02.810
Because Chopper is
a true friend of mine!

00:45:04.380 --> 00:45:06.570
- Luffy!
- Oh no!

00:45:07.780 --> 00:45:09.100
A true friend...

00:45:11.430 --> 00:45:14.060
Nothing can cure a fool.

00:45:22.740 --> 00:45:25.210
Doctor... I...

00:45:31.900 --> 00:45:33.610
And as for you...

00:45:34.100 --> 00:45:35.250
Stop it!

00:45:36.620 --> 00:45:40.050
- Chopper!
- What? I'm done with you.

00:45:40.420 --> 00:45:42.850
But...I'm not done with you!!

00:45:44.780 --> 00:45:48.770
Not done?
You want to run some more?

00:45:49.500 --> 00:45:54.490
I didn't run. I just led them away
from the other animals!

00:45:55.820 --> 00:45:57.220
Rumble!

00:45:57.300 --> 00:45:58.370
Jumping Point!

00:46:02.980 --> 00:46:03.970
Loser.

00:46:04.260 --> 00:46:05.770
Arm Point!

00:46:06.060 --> 00:46:09.020
Hoof mark...petal!!

00:46:09.530 --> 00:46:11.520
- Yes!
- Get him, Chopper!

00:46:17.730 --> 00:46:21.980
How dare you hit a genius
in his forehead?

00:46:23.850 --> 00:46:26.000
Meanie, meanie, meanie!

00:46:29.440 --> 00:46:30.550
Chopper!

00:46:32.200 --> 00:46:33.280
Chopper!

00:46:35.560 --> 00:46:37.720
Chopper! Don't die!

00:46:37.990 --> 00:46:42.340
You... now I get it.
You are his son!

00:46:42.710 --> 00:46:45.600
That's why a kid like you is here.

00:46:45.670 --> 00:46:46.900
You know my dad?

00:46:46.990 --> 00:46:48.810
I was a biologist too.

00:46:48.940 --> 00:46:52.770
But your dad didn't want
to tell me the secret...

00:46:52.860 --> 00:46:56.290
He said it was for the animals' sake.

00:46:56.460 --> 00:47:01.050
So I ambushed his ship,
and killed him with this!

00:47:03.560 --> 00:47:04.830
You killed him!

00:47:05.130 --> 00:47:07.350
You filthy pirate!

00:47:07.690 --> 00:47:10.120
I'm no silly pirate!

00:47:10.200 --> 00:47:11.180
What?

00:47:11.260 --> 00:47:16.890
Of course I'm not a pirate!
You're dumber than you look, kid.

00:47:17.180 --> 00:47:19.210
You're not... a pirate?

00:47:19.510 --> 00:47:25.130
Cheer up. You'll join your dad
and the reindeer soon enough.

00:47:25.420 --> 00:47:26.900
Don't you touch him!

00:47:27.060 --> 00:47:29.100
You can't do a thing!

00:47:30.420 --> 00:47:34.130
You can't do a thing!
Sit back or get hurt!

00:47:34.800 --> 00:47:37.520
If... If I really try...

00:47:38.240 --> 00:47:40.880
...maybe I can do something!

00:47:51.830 --> 00:47:52.530
What?

00:48:07.720 --> 00:48:09.430
Mobambi! Are you OK?

00:48:09.560 --> 00:48:13.720
What the... do you all
want to get killed?

00:48:14.040 --> 00:48:16.150
Fools, the lot of you!

00:48:22.440 --> 00:48:24.550
You can't do anything!

00:48:42.060 --> 00:48:44.570
You...aren't you dead yet?

00:48:44.740 --> 00:48:48.330
Gum-Gum...Gatling!!

00:48:48.400 --> 00:48:49.750
It's useless!

00:48:56.080 --> 00:48:57.350
Get off me!

00:48:58.480 --> 00:49:00.560
The King is absolute!

00:49:04.320 --> 00:49:07.790
Do you get it? The king here is me!

00:49:07.960 --> 00:49:10.790
- You're no king!
- What?

00:49:11.330 --> 00:49:14.840
These guys knew what awaited them!

00:49:15.280 --> 00:49:17.840
Yet they fought...for their friend!

00:49:18.440 --> 00:49:20.630
And you laughed at them,

00:49:20.720 --> 00:49:23.360
you lowly no-life!

00:49:36.880 --> 00:49:39.550
Gum-Gum...

00:49:39.680 --> 00:49:41.760
...Bazooka!

00:49:58.960 --> 00:50:00.110
Straw Hat.

00:50:00.840 --> 00:50:04.880
Thank you.
I think I'm a bit stronger now.

00:50:05.000 --> 00:50:06.030
Great.

00:50:07.320 --> 00:50:10.230
I can survive even if I'm exiled.

00:50:10.360 --> 00:50:12.390
Exiled? What do you mean?

00:50:12.520 --> 00:50:17.190
I wasted and lost the island's
greatest treasure...

00:50:17.760 --> 00:50:19.430
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:50:19.960 --> 00:50:21.990
Why don't you ask them?

00:50:22.160 --> 00:50:25.510
- Where have you been?
- Shut up.

00:50:25.600 --> 00:50:26.920
Everyone...

00:50:29.440 --> 00:50:32.990
Forgive me! I lost the King's Treasure.

00:50:33.160 --> 00:50:34.510
I'm really sorry!

00:50:42.080 --> 00:50:43.150
What's this?

00:50:43.320 --> 00:50:46.990
What do you think?
Your courage paid off!

00:50:47.120 --> 00:50:50.150
They want you to stay with them.

00:50:50.370 --> 00:50:52.590
So... I can stay here?

00:50:52.720 --> 00:50:55.530
Of course, silly boy!

00:50:55.720 --> 00:50:57.230
Thank you!

00:50:58.800 --> 00:50:59.790
Chopper!

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:04.910
You'll stay here with us, right?
We're friends. You're one of us!

00:51:05.040 --> 00:51:08.270
It's a great place.
You'll love it here!

00:51:08.440 --> 00:51:09.670
Mobambi...

00:51:09.920 --> 00:51:13.590
Right, Chopper? You're our friend!

00:51:16.280 --> 00:51:20.270
But I'm a pirate.
And you hate pirates, right?

00:51:20.360 --> 00:51:21.630
No, that's not...

00:51:23.520 --> 00:51:27.400
<i>Because Chopper is
a true friend of mine!</i>

00:51:32.800 --> 00:51:35.360
Yes, I hate pirates!

00:51:35.440 --> 00:51:38.360
Get out of here, you creep!

00:51:38.480 --> 00:51:39.670
Mobambi...

00:51:41.280 --> 00:51:42.310
What now?

00:51:42.440 --> 00:51:43.630
The volcanoes!

00:51:45.480 --> 00:51:47.790
This doesn't look good!

00:51:48.080 --> 00:51:49.950
Calm down!

00:51:58.560 --> 00:51:59.590
How beautiful.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:01.080
My...

00:52:07.410 --> 00:52:10.310
<i>When a crown envelops the isle...</i>

00:52:10.400 --> 00:52:14.710
<i>Heavens shall give us new blood...</i>

00:52:16.480 --> 00:52:18.640
Heaven accepts Mobambi!

00:52:18.720 --> 00:52:22.760
Mobambi is the true animal king!

00:52:29.240 --> 00:52:30.640
Mobambi.

00:52:30.720 --> 00:52:33.600
We're friends even if we're far apart!

00:52:57.420 --> 00:52:59.890
That was some adventure.

00:53:00.380 --> 00:53:02.330
I'm completely beat.

00:53:02.420 --> 00:53:05.530
Partying all night long.

00:53:05.910 --> 00:53:08.380
And no treasure for us.

00:53:08.510 --> 00:53:11.700
Well, we got the real treasure back.

00:53:11.950 --> 00:53:14.980
Real treasure? What did you find?

00:53:15.480 --> 00:53:17.220
You, Chopper.

00:53:17.600 --> 00:53:19.230
Me? Huh?

00:53:19.390 --> 00:53:20.900
Ooh, strong winds.

00:53:21.110 --> 00:53:22.620
Will we make it?

00:53:22.750 --> 00:53:25.180
A pirate can't be afraid of this!

00:53:25.270 --> 00:53:31.180
We'll see man-eating goldfish, evil
whales and killer noodles soon!

00:53:33.790 --> 00:53:34.980
I can handle it!

00:53:40.430 --> 00:53:44.310
OK! Then full speed ahead!

00:53:55.280 --> 00:54:01.670
<i>Mabushikute aoi sora miagetara </i>

00:53:55.280 --> 00:54:01.670
<i>\h\h\hWhen I look up at
the dazzling blue sky</i>

00:54:01.840 --> 00:54:08.070
<i>Kazemuki mo ki ni shinaide
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hfurikaerazu ni </i>

00:54:01.840 --> 00:54:08.070
<i>I don't let the wind bother me,
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hI don't turn back</i>

00:54:08.160 --> 00:54:14.550
<i>Hate shinai sora to umi no aida ni</i>

00:54:08.160 --> 00:54:14.550
<i>Where the endless sky and sea touch</i>

00:54:14.720 --> 00:54:21.750
<i>Yume no pazuru wo sagashite
\h\h\h\h\hmichibikareru mama sa</i>

00:54:14.720 --> 00:54:21.750
<i>We look for puzzle pieces of our dreams
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hLetting ourselves be guided</i>

00:54:27.720 --> 00:54:33.750
<i>Nageyari ni kizamareta kotoba
sagashi motometa imiteeshon</i>

00:54:27.720 --> 00:54:33.750
<i>\h\h\h\h\hThose recklessly carved words
The meaning we've been searching for</i>

00:54:33.840 --> 00:54:41.310
<i>Maketakunai to butsukattetemo
\h\h\h\hkizuite iru sono yasashisa</i>

00:54:33.840 --> 00:54:41.310
<i>Even if we fight not wanting to lose
\h\h\h\hWe see each other's kindness</i>

00:54:41.440 --> 00:54:46.430
<i>Mou tsuyogarazu ni uchiakeyou</i>

00:54:41.440 --> 00:54:46.430
<i>Don't worry about being tough,
\h\h\h\h\h\h\hand speak your mind</i>

00:54:46.520 --> 00:54:52.000
<i>chikara wo awasete, ima</i>

00:54:46.520 --> 00:54:52.000
<i>Let's join forces now</i>

00:54:54.480 --> 00:55:00.870
<i>Mabushikute kimi dake
\h\h\h\h\h\hwo mitsumetara </i>

00:54:54.480 --> 00:55:00.870
<i>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hSo dazzling
When I only looked at you</i>

00:55:00.960 --> 00:55:07.230
<i>\h\h\hKachimake mo ki ni
shinai yo akiramenaide</i>

00:55:00.960 --> 00:55:07.230
<i>Winning and losing didn't matter
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hI won't give up</i>

00:55:07.320 --> 00:55:13.710
<i>Sora ni mau hitohira
\h\ho kumo no you ni</i>

00:55:07.320 --> 00:55:13.710
<i>Just like the whispers of clouds
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hthat dance in the sky</i>

00:55:13.840 --> 00:55:20.870
<i>Dokomademo oikakete
kono te tsukamu no sa</i>

00:55:13.840 --> 00:55:20.870
<i>\h\h\h\hI'll follow them wherever
And grasp them in my hands</i>
